{"overview":"دهداک‌پور، بلژیک بیهار، در آستانهٔ جشن ۲۵ سال بدون جرم است. اما هرج و مرج به‌وجود می‌آید وقتی موتورسیکلت نادیده‌ای که به‌عنوان هدیهٔ عروسی خریداری شده، هفت روز پیش از مراسم دزدیده می‌شود! سفری که خانوادهٔ عروس و عشق‌پیشین او برای یافتن دوپاهیا می‌پیمایند، قلب این کمدی را تشکیل می‌دهد و امیدها و آرزوهای مردم ساده را به تصویر می‌کشد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Dhadakpur, the Belgium of Bihar, is on the cusp of celebrating 25 years of being crime free. But chaos strikes when a never-seen-before motorbike, that was purchased as a wedding gift gets stolen 7 days before the ceremony! The journey taken by the bride's family and ex-lover to find the Dupahiya forms the heart of this comedy, which explores the hopes and aspirations of simple people.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":9,"y":2025,"poster":"/7kbmuNn37gENS4nq1CDSKGQbHia.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":8,"y":2026,"poster":"/dP6DaMzM8hdG6EcI9keqkgW1l4J.jpg"}],"episodes":17,"crew":["Sonam Nair","Chirag Garg","Avinash Dwivedi","Shubh Shivdasani"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["IN"],"cast":[{"name":"गजराज राव","role":"Banwari Jha","photo":"/pomm4rYhIDqoEHtzKucbEOoJp7n.jpg","en":"Gajraj Rao"},{"name":"Bhuvan Arora","role":"Amavas","photo":"/AtEfX9ta8LZTWh7yZ4dVc2wpIRO.jpg"},{"name":"स्पर्श श्रीवास्तव","role":"Bhugol Jha","photo":"/d123XZfocCLnc5LAjrlBifffYFf.jpg","en":"Sparsh Shrivastava"},{"name":"Shivani Raghuvanshi","role":"Roshni Jha","photo":"/6FPUkeFFJ9IlnKJXy0RTj3IOQ1P.jpg"},{"name":"Renuka Shahane","role":"Pushplata Yadav","photo":"/vTHNsCtOCRrRf643XNWNK4goPpY.jpg"},{"name":"Yashpal Sharma","role":"Mithlesh Khuswaha","photo":"/hYDZkMl6u3rM2cASabpHgrvA0mf.jpg"},{"name":"Anjuman Saxena","role":"Malti Jha","photo":"/lRlbH3fMAejg9wJlIFI2f0nbg17.jpg"},{"name":"Komal Kushwaha","role":"Nirmal Yadav","photo":""},{"name":"Dinesh Lal Yadav Nirahua","role":"Pratham Kumar","photo":"/flTi9LuCoEkWX5zUNnBC5brdIzT.jpg"}],"trailer":"xjR518LxjZE","watch":